OL,12,     Fconfrontation.
OL,13,G1800 Police Interceptors
OL,14,     FWest Yorkshire is one of the UK's
OL,15,     Fhighest crime areas. With this
OL,16,     Fregion seeing criminal activity
OL,17,     Flevels rising, the Interceptors
OL,18,     Fuse every tool in their arsenal.
